up and task/launch-mode details are omitted from this resolution model.", "packets": [{"edge": "deliver", "label": "launch", "tone": "fwd", "kind": "parcel"}], "set": {"nodes": {"target": ["is-active", "Intent received"]}, "visuals": {"target": {"visible": true}}}}, {"caption": "The receiving app validates the incoming route and data before opening order 43. An exported entry point must not trust caller-supplied content.", "set": {"nodes": {"target": ["is-done", "validated order route"]}, "visuals": {"target": {"rows": 3}}}}, {"caption": "Without an eligible handler, the caller needs a failure path. When a choice is required, resolution waits for that choice rather than sending a packet to an arbitrary activity.", "set": {"nodes": {"resolver": ["", "handle other outcomes"]}}}]}}, "illustrated": true, "edgeEndpoints": {"request": {"from": "caller", "to": "resolver"}, "deliver": {"from": "resolver", "to": "target"}}}</script>
